FILES
  whale-girl.png     original artwork (as published)
  avatar-128.png     centre-cropped square, for the UI
  avatar-256.png     centre-cropped square, larger
  spritesheet.webp   animation frames, from the codex-pet-DeepSeek-girl project

USING THIS PLUGIN COMMERCIALLY
  Replace the files in this directory with artwork you hold the rights to.
  The plugin does not depend on them: delete them, or point the "avatar path"
  setting in the panel at your own image, and everything else keeps working.
